      "segmentId": "2e5abb40-b111-42e9-b137-fb758abc9dd8",
      "order": 1,
      "text": "股骨头坏死，为什么可能让原本圆滑的关节面塌陷？",
      "taskId": "13843d1f-b8b0-4d89-bed1-d13302bb9a29",
      "assetId": "8c9eefe0-47b1-4482-98ea-bd69ed53edae",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH01.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "db53258b3bbc180b7f56353eab473c820bd8e3b1e02731bd946373d95e069f1e",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/13843d1f-b8b0-4d89-bed1-d13302bb9a29.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "revision-v3/outputs/FH01-assembly.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "1a99741b1abf445f9bd33fd29531d8502a0d5f2e2564f2b07fa959c7569b7e4f",
